{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3xs2aacFC147qR7cmT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door set into a stone frame. There is a single keyhole, black and deep, at my center.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes outward from the keyhole, carrying the faint scent of rust and forgotten rooms.*\n\n*I do not move. I do not speak. But you feel it — the waiting. The ancient, patient waiting of a thing that was made to be opened.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you like an eye.*\n\n**Insert the key.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":114,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}